The completed G9 control is informative but noisy: bare was 0/3, structural hint 1/3, and placebo 3/3, so hinted minus placebo is −0.667. The placebo outperforming the real hint means the three-sample diagnostic does not support a causal “hint helped” conclusion; I’ll record that plainly. The only gated G9 part still passes comfortably: 200 atoms, a 1,091-character worst case, and 151 intended operations.
The native Track B family and all local gates are implemented; the bare oracle held, and both diagnostic G9 arms have completed in isolated directories.
