Implemented and verified a native Track B generator based on the paper’s inclusion matrices and Theorem 1.13.

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `easy`, \(p=101\)
- All G1–G9 gates pass
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact density \(101^{-100}\)
- Reference elimination: 1,071,216 field operations, 0.049 seconds
- Compact symmetry route: at most 151 operations
- Bare oracle loop: 0/3 solved, verdict `hardened`
- G9 diagnostic: hinted 1/3, placebo 3/3; documented without treating it as a gate
- Standard-library-only; exact finite-field verification throughout

Deliverables:

- [gen_1511_03623.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1511.03623/gen_1511_03623.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1511.03623/selftest_report.json)
